      "seed": 1304891006,
      "version": 628,
      "versionNonce": 1697527906,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786366151228,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Theme:\n- green-ish colours, like a salat\n- colour palette:\n    Primary, Salatgrün, #5B8C51\nSecondary, Tomatenrot (Akzent), #E07856\nAccent, Zitronengelb, #EFC94C\nBase-100 (BG), Cremeweiß, #FAF7F0\nBase-200, Helles Beige, #F0EBDD\nNeutral/Text, Dunkles Olivgrün, #2F3B2A",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Theme:\n- green-ish colours, like a salat\n- colour palette:\n    Primary, Salatgrün, #5B8C51\nSecondary, Tomatenrot (Akzent), #E07856\nAccent, Zitronengelb, #EFC94C\nBase-100 (BG), Cremeweiß, #FAF7F0\nBase-200, Helles Beige, #F0EBDD\nNeutral/Text, Dunkles Olivgrün, #2F3B2A",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6adqH0BA0DrHhgnmvhFsi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 236.6796875,
      "y": 245.548828125,
      "width": 585.2838134765625,
      "height": 490,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 86045218,
      "version": 513,
      "versionNonce": 1923838462,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786365941617,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functions:\n- \"add entry\" button\n- pop-up with entry form \n    (inputs for title, date, img url, content)\n    -> all fields need to be filled\n- entry stored in local storage\n- one entry per day\n    (output \"come back tomorrow\")\n- sort entries by date\n- only one entry per day\n- card layout\n    (only title, img, date on preview)\n    -> onClick full view in pop-up\n- buttons to edit / delete entry",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functions:\n- \"add entry\" button\n- pop-up with entry form \n    (inputs for title, date, img url, content)\n    -> all fields need to be filled\n- entry stored in local storage\n- one entry per day\n    (output \"come back tomorrow\")\n- sort entries by date\n- only one entry per day\n- card layout\n    (only title, img, date on preview)\n    -> onClick full view in pop-up\n- buttons to edit / delete entry",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
